LS.add({"965b44b885":{"t":"M46 Since by man came death 死既是因一人而來","b":3,"k":"unit","h":"<nav class=\"cr\" style=\"--c:#b03a2e\"><a href=\"index.html\">燈臺 <i lang=\"en\">The Lampstand</i></a> <span class=\"sep\">›</span> <a class=\"fl0\" href=\"#ic38303dbb5\">3 聖經真理 Bible Truths</a> <span class=\"sep\">›</span> <a class=\"fl1\" href=\"#i98b8112a72\">Handel&#x27;s Messiah 韓德爾《彌賽亞》</a> <span class=\"sep\">›</span> <a class=\"fl2\" href=\"#i048c4a61a5\">3 第三部 Part III</a></nav><h1 class=\"fl3\" id=\"m46-since-by-man-came-death-死既是因一人而來\">M46 Since by man came death <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">死既是因一人而來</span></h1><details class=\"toc\"><summary>目錄 <i lang=\"en\">Contents</i></summary><ol><li class=\"l2\"><a href=\"#%E6%AD%8C%E8%A9%9E-libretto-verbatim\">歌詞 Libretto (verbatim)</a></li><li class=\"l2\"><a href=\"#%E7%B6%93%E6%96%87-scripture\">經文 Scripture</a></li><li class=\"l3\"><a href=\"#1-corinthians-1521-22-%E5%93%A5%E6%9E%97%E5%A4%9A%E5%89%8D%E6%9B%B8-1521-22\">1 Corinthians 15:21-22 哥林多前書 15:21-22</a></li><li class=\"l2\"><a href=\"#%E7%94%A8%E9%80%94-use\">用途 Use</a></li><li class=\"l2\"><a href=\"#tag-words-%E6%A8%99%E7%B1%A4%E8%A9%9E\">Tag words 標籤詞</a></li><li class=\"l2\"><a href=\"#%E9%80%A3%E7%B5%90-connections\">連結 Connections</a></li></ol></details>\n<p><strong>Novello (Watkins Shaw)</strong> 46 · <strong>Bärenreiter (Tobin)</strong> 41 · <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">第三部</span> Part III, scene 1: <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">身體復活的應許，從亞當的墮落得贖</span> The promise of bodily resurrection and redemption from Adam's fall</p>\n<p>← <a class=\"wl\" href=\"#ib06f309cf8\">M45</a> · <a class=\"wl\" href=\"#if16f702dad\">M47</a> →</p>\n<h2 id=\"歌詞-libretto-verbatim\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">歌詞</span> Libretto (verbatim)</h2>\n<p><strong>1749 printed wordbook</strong> (Watts; the old long s written s, the capital second letter after a drop capital written small, a word broken by the page joined; nothing else touched):</p>\n<p><em>Chorus.</em></p>\n<blockquote><p>Since by Man came Death,</p></blockquote>\n<blockquote><p>By Man came also the Resurrection of the Dead;</p></blockquote>\n<blockquote><p>For as in Adam all die,</p></blockquote>\n<blockquote><p>Even so in Christ shall all be made alive.</p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>Sung text, from the score</strong> (Chorus):</p>\n<blockquote><p>Since by man came death, by man came also the resurrection of the dead. For as in Adam all die, even so in Christ shall all be made alive.</p></blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"經文-scripture\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">經文</span> Scripture <a class=\"up\" href=\"#%E6%AD%8C%E8%A9%9E-libretto-verbatim\" title=\"回到摘要 back to the summary\">↑</a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"1-corinthians-1521-22-哥林多前書-1521-22\"><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.15.21-22\">1 Corinthians 15:21-22</span> <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">哥林多前書</span> 15:21-22</h3>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">歌詞與經文</span> Libretto against the verse.</strong> This part of the libretto: <em>Since by Man came Death, By Man came also the Resurrection of the Dead; For as in Adam all die, Even so in Christ shall all be made alive.</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">與</span> KJV <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">比較</span> Against the KJV: starts after ‘For’.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>English, KJV 1769</strong><code></code></p>\n<blockquote class=\"verse\"><div class=\"en\">\"For since by man came death, by man came also the resurrection of the dead.\" (<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.15.21\">1 Corinthians 15:21</span>, KJV)</div><div class=\"en\">\"For as in Adam all die, even so in Christ shall all be made alive.\" (<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.15.22\">1 Corinthians 15:22</span>, KJV)</div></blockquote>\n<p><strong>English, ASV 1901</strong><code></code></p>\n<blockquote class=\"verse\"><div class=\"en\">For since by man came death, by man came also the resurrection of the dead. (<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.15.21\">1 Corinthians 15:21</span>, ASV)</div><div class=\"en\">For as in Adam all die, so also in Christ shall all be made alive. (<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.15.22\">1 Corinthians 15:22</span>, ASV)</div></blockquote>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">中文 和合本</span></strong><code></code></p>\n<blockquote class=\"verse\"><div class=\"zh\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">死既是因一人而來，死人復活也是因一人而來。（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.15.21\">哥林多前書 15:21</span>）</span></div><div class=\"zh\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">在亞當裏眾人都死了；照樣，在基督裏眾人也都要復活。（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.15.22\">哥林多前書 15:22</span>）</span></div></blockquote>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"grc\">Ελληνικά</span> Greek, New Testament, OpenGNT 3.3 (the closest equivalent to NA28)</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p><span lang=\"grc\">ἐπειδὴ γὰρ δι᾽ ἀνθρώπου θάνατος καὶ δι᾽ ἀνθρώπου ἀνάστασις νεκρῶν</span> (15:21, OpenGNT)<br><span lang=\"grc\">ὥσπερ γὰρ ἐν τῷ Ἀδὰμ πάντες ἀποθνήσκουσιν οὕτως καὶ ἐν τῷ Χριστῷ πάντες ζωοποιηθήσονται</span> (15:22, OpenGNT)</p></blockquote>\n<p><strong><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">עברית</span> Hebrew New Testament, Delitzsch 1892 (a translation into Hebrew, not an original; no independent second check)</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">כִּי אַחֲרֵי אֲשֶׁר־בָּא הַמָּוֶת עַל־יְדֵי אָדָם גַּם־תְּחִיַּת הַמֵּתִים בָּאָה עַל־יְדֵי אָדָם</span> (15:21, Delitzsch 1892)<br><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">כִּי כַּאֲשֶׁר בָּאָדָם הָרִאשׁוֹן מֵתִים כֻּלָּם כֵּן יִחְיוּ כֻלָּם בַּמָּשִׁיחַ</span> (15:22, Delitzsch 1892)</p></blockquote>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"用途-use\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">用途</span> Use <a class=\"up\" href=\"#%E6%AD%8C%E8%A9%9E-libretto-verbatim\" title=\"回到摘要 back to the summary\">↑</a></h2>\n\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">教會年曆</span> Church year: <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">復活節</span> Easter</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">場合</span> Occasions: <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">喪禮</span> funerals</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">講道主題</span> Sermon topics: <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">亞當與基督</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">一百課</span> Lessons: <span class=\"off\">41 <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">始祖墮落</span> Through Adam sin entered the world</span> · <span class=\"off\">18 <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">身體復活</span> The resurrection of the body</span> · <a class=\"wl\" href=\"#i969a855a0f\">01 <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">身體復活</span> The bodily resurrection of Jesus</a> · <span class=\"off\">22 <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">罪的工價</span> The wages of sin is death; sin separates us from God</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">書卷研究</span> Book studies: 1 Corinthians </li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"tag-words-標籤詞\">Tag words <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">標籤詞</span> <a class=\"up\" href=\"#%E6%AD%8C%E8%A9%9E-libretto-verbatim\" title=\"回到摘要 back to the summary\">↑</a></h2>\n<p>#t/death <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">死</span> · #t/resurrection <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">復活</span> · #t/man <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">人</span> · #t/life <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">生命</span> · #t/christ <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">彌賽亞</span> · #book/1-corinthians <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">哥林多前書</span><br></p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">四語</span> Four faces</strong> — <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">中文</span> · English · Hebrew · Greek (H/G = Strong's, n× = times in the Hebrew OT / Greek NT):</p>\n<ul>\n<li>#t/death <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">死</span> · death · <span class=\"off\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">מוּת</span></span> H4191 840× (<span class=\"off\">Qal</span>) / <span class=\"off\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">מָוֶת</span></span> H4194 155× · <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">νεκρός</span></span> G3498 128× / <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">θάνατος</span></span> G2288 120× / <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ἀποθνῄσκω</span></span> G599 111×</li>\n<li>#t/resurrection <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">復活</span> · resurrection · <span class=\"off\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">קוּם</span></span> H6965 628× (<span class=\"off\">Qal</span>) · <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ἐγείρω</span></span> G1453 144× / <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ἀνίστημι</span></span> G450 108× / <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ἀνάστασις</span></span> G386 42×</li>\n<li>#t/man <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">人</span> · man · <span class=\"off\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">אִישׁ</span></span> H376 2,007× / <span class=\"off\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">אָדָם</span></span> H120 552× · <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ἄνθρωπος</span></span> G444 550× / <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ἀνήρ</span></span> G435 216×</li>\n<li>#t/life <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">生命</span> · life · <span class=\"off\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">חַי</span></span> H2416 503× / <span class=\"off\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">חָיָה</span></span> H2421 263× (<span class=\"off\">Qal</span>) / <span class=\"off\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">עֵץ</span></span> <span class=\"off\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">חַי</span></span> H6086+H2416 7× · <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ζάω</span></span> G2198 140× / <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ζωή</span></span> G2222 135× / <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ξύλον</span></span> <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ζωή</span></span> G3586+G2222 4×</li>\n<li>#t/christ <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">彌賽亞</span> · Christ · <a class=\"wl\" href=\"#i1b5f27bacc\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">מָשִׁיחַ</span></a> H4899 39× · <a class=\"wl\" href=\"#i1b5f27bacc\"><span lang=\"grc\">Χριστός</span></a> G5547 529×</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"連結-connections\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">連結</span> Connections <a class=\"up\" href=\"#%E6%AD%8C%E8%A9%9E-libretto-verbatim\" title=\"回到摘要 back to the summary\">↑</a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">原文研究</span> Messiah word study: <a class=\"wl\" href=\"#i1b5f27bacc\">S18 Messiah <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">彌賽亞</span></a></li>\n\n</ul>\n<details class=\"pn across\" open><summary>跨燈 <i lang=\"en\">Across the lamps</i></summary><p class=\"acr\" data-b=\"3\"></p></details>"},"969a855a0f":{"t":"01 身體復活 The bodily resurrection of Jesus","b":3,"k":"unit","h":"<nav class=\"cr\" style=\"--c:#b03a2e\"><a href=\"index.html\">燈臺 <i lang=\"en\">The Lampstand</i></a> <span class=\"sep\">›</span> <a class=\"fl0\" href=\"#ic38303dbb5\">3 聖經真理 Bible Truths</a> <span class=\"sep\">›</span> <a class=\"fl1\" href=\"#i4640b6fad5\">Lessons 課程</a></nav><h1 class=\"fl2\" id=\"第一課--身體復活-the-bodily-resurrection-of-jesus\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">第一課 · 身體復活</span> The bodily resurrection of Jesus</h1><details class=\"toc\"><summary>目錄 <i lang=\"en\">Contents</i></summary><ol><li class=\"l2\"><a href=\"#%E6%91%98%E8%A6%81-summary\">摘要 Summary</a></li><li class=\"l2\"><a href=\"#1-%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%86-the-truth\">1. 真理 The truth</a></li><li class=\"l2\"><a href=\"#2-%E8%B2%AB%E7%A9%BF%E5%85%A8%E6%9C%AC%E8%81%96%E7%B6%93-through-the-whole-bible\">2. 貫穿全本聖經 Through the whole Bible</a></li><li class=\"l3\"><a href=\"#2a-%E6%87%89%E8%A8%B1-the-promises\">2a. 應許 The promises</a></li><li class=\"l3\"><a href=\"#2b-%E7%B4%84-the-covenant\">2b. 約 The covenant</a></li><li class=\"l3\"><a href=\"#2c-%E9%A0%90%E8%A1%A8-the-types\">2c. 預表 The types</a></li><li class=\"l3\"><a href=\"#2d-%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B-the-stories\">2d. 故事 The stories</a></li><li class=\"l3\"><a href=\"#2e-%E5%9C%A8%E5%9F%BA%E7%9D%A3%E8%A3%8F%E6%88%90%E5%85%A8-fulfilled-in-christ\">2e. 在基督裏成全 Fulfilled in Christ</a></li><li class=\"l2\"><a href=\"#3-%E5%8E%9F%E6%96%87-the-words-beneath-it\">3. 原文 The words beneath it</a></li><li class=\"l2\"><a href=\"#4-%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E7%9A%84%E4%BF%A1%E4%BB%B0-what-all-confess\">4. 共同的信仰 What all confess</a></li><li class=\"l2\"><a href=\"#5-%E7%82%BA%E4%BD%95%E9%87%8D%E8%A6%81-why-it-matters\">5. 為何重要 Why it matters</a></li><li class=\"l3\"><a href=\"#5a-%E5%8D%81%E9%A0%85%E5%8F%B2%E5%AF%A6-the-ten-facts\">5a. 十項史實 The ten facts</a></li><li class=\"l3\"><a href=\"#5b-%E5%85%AD%E5%80%8B%E8%B3%AA%E7%96%91-six-objections\">5b. 六個質疑 Six objections</a></li><li class=\"l2\"><a href=\"#6-%E5%AF%A6%E8%B8%90-in-practice\">6. 實踐 In practice</a></li><li class=\"l2\"><a href=\"#7-%E9%80%A3%E5%9C%A8%E4%B8%80%E8%B5%B7-connected\">7. 連在一起 Connected</a></li><li class=\"l2\"><a href=\"#8-%E6%87%89%E7%94%A8%E8%88%87%E8%AC%9B%E9%81%93-for-us-and-for-the-preacher\">8. 應用與講道 For us, and for the preacher</a></li><li class=\"l2\"><a href=\"#9-%E8%A4%87%E7%BF%92-five-review-questions\">9. 複習 Five review questions</a></li><li class=\"l2\"><a href=\"#10-%E9%80%A3%E7%B5%90%E8%88%87%E5%87%BA%E8%99%95-links-and-sources\">10. 連結與出處 Links and sources</a></li><li class=\"l2\"><a href=\"#tag-words-%E6%A8%99%E7%B1%A4%E8%A9%9E\">Tag words 標籤詞</a></li></ol></details>\n<p><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">聖經真理</span></span> · <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">信經與信條</span></span> · <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">下一課：</span><a class=\"wl\" href=\"#i2f493f5679\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">第 2 課 基督再來</span></a></p>\n\n<h2 id=\"摘要-summary\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">摘要</span> Summary</h2>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">一句話：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">第三天，耶穌帶着被釘、被埋葬的身體從死裏復活，永不再死。這是全本聖經的盼望，福音的根基，也是我們身體復活的保證。</span><br><em>In one line: on the third day Jesus rose bodily from the dead, never to die again: the hope of the whole Bible, the heart of the gospel, the pledge of our own rising.</em></p>\n<div class=\"tw\"><table><thead><tr><th><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">一頁看全課</span></th><th>At a glance</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href=\"#1-%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%86-the-truth\"><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">真理</span></strong> The truth</a></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">同一個身體復活，永不再死（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Luke.24.39\">路 24:39</span>）。</span></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#2-%E8%B2%AB%E7%A9%BF%E5%85%A8%E6%9C%AC%E8%81%96%E7%B6%93-through-the-whole-bible\"><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">全本聖經</span></strong> The Bible</a></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">應許、約、預表、故事，在基督裏成全（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.15.3-8\">林前 15:3-8</span>）。</span></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#3-%E5%8E%9F%E6%96%87-the-words-beneath-it\"><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">原文</span></strong> The words</a></td><td><span lang=\"grc\">ἀνάστασις</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">、</span><span lang=\"grc\">ἐγείρω</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">、</span><span lang=\"grc\">ἀνίστημι</span> <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">與</span> <span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">קוּם</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">；詩</span> 16:10 → <span lang=\"zh-Hant\"><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Acts.2.27\">徒 2:27</span> 的</span> <span lang=\"grc\">διαφθορά</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「朽壞」。</span></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#4-%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E7%9A%84%E4%BF%A1%E4%BB%B0-what-all-confess\"><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">信經</span></strong> The creeds</a></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">各傳統同認「第三天從死裏復活」；只有復活節的日期不同。</span></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#5-%E7%82%BA%E4%BD%95%E9%87%8D%E8%A6%81-why-it-matters\"><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">為何重要</span></strong> Why</a></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">沒有復活，信仰就枉然（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.15.14\">林前 15:14</span>）；十項史實；六個質疑。</span></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#6-%E5%AF%A6%E8%B8%90-in-practice\"><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">實踐</span></strong> In practice</a></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">復活節講道的五點。</span></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#7-%E9%80%A3%E5%9C%A8%E4%B8%80%E8%B5%B7-connected\"><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">連在一起</span></strong> Connected</a></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">原文研究、希伯來書、講道、寇爾森、倖存者之樹。</span></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#8-%E6%87%89%E7%94%A8%E8%88%87%E8%AC%9B%E9%81%93-for-us-and-for-the-preacher\"><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">講道</span></strong> To preach it</a></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\"><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.15.20\">林前 15:20</span>：事實、保證、盼望。</span></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#9-%E8%A4%87%E7%BF%92-five-review-questions\"><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">複習</span></strong> Review</a></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">五題，附答案與經文。</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<blockquote class=\"verse\"><div class=\"zh\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">但基督已經從死裏復活，成為睡了之人初熟的果子。（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.15.20\">哥林多前書 15:20</span>）</span></div><div class=\"en\">But now hath Christ been raised from the dead, the firstfruits of them that are asleep. (<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.15.20\">1 Corinthians 15:20</span>, ASV)</div></blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"1-真理-the-truth\">1. <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">真理</span> The truth <a class=\"up\" href=\"#%E6%91%98%E8%A6%81-summary\" title=\"回到摘要 back to the summary\">↑</a></h2>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">第三天，耶穌帶着自己的身體從死裏復活：就是那被釘、被埋葬的身體，如今復活成為不朽壞的；不是魂，也不是甦醒後還要再死的屍體。</span></strong><br><em>On the third day Jesus rose from the dead in his own body, the body that was crucified and buried, now raised imperishable: not a ghost, and not a corpse revived to die again.</em></p>\n<blockquote class=\"verse\"><div class=\"zh\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">你們看我的手，我的腳，就知道實在是我了。摸我看看！魂無骨無肉，你們看，我是有的。」（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Luke.24.39\">路加福音 24:39</span>）</span></div><div class=\"en\">See my hands and my feet, that it is I myself: handle me, and see; for a spirit hath not flesh and bones, as ye behold me having. (<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Luke.24.39\">Luke 24:39</span>, ASV)</div></blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"2-貫穿全本聖經-through-the-whole-bible\">2. <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">貫穿全本聖經</span> Through the whole Bible <a class=\"up\" href=\"#%E6%91%98%E8%A6%81-summary\" title=\"回到摘要 back to the summary\">↑</a></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">保羅兩次說「照聖經所說」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.15.3-4\">1 Cor 15:3-4</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）；復活的主也說：「照經上所寫的，基督必受害，第三日從死裏復活」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Luke.24.46\">Luke 24:46</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"2a-應許-the-promises\">2a. <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">應許</span> The promises</h3>\n<ol>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\"><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Ps.16.10\">詩 16:10</span>：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「也不叫你的聖者見朽壞」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Ps.16.10\">Ps 16:10</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。大衛死了，墳墓還在；這話應驗在基督身上（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Acts.2.25-32\">徒 2:25-32</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Acts.13.35-37\">13:35-37</span>）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\"><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Isa.26.19\">賽 26:19</span>：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「死人〔原文作你的死人〕要復活，屍首〔原文作我的屍首〕要興起」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Isa.26.19\">Isa 26:19</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）：起來的是身體。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\"><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Dan.12.2\">但 12:2</span>：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「睡在塵埃中的，必有多人復醒」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Dan.12.2\">Dan 12:2</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）：有得永生的，有受羞辱的（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.5.28-29\">約 5:28-29</span>）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\"><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Job.19.25\">伯 19:25</span>：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「我知道我的救贖主活着」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Job.19.25\">Job 19:25</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">耶穌自己：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「過三天復活」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Mark.8.31\">Mark 8:31</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）；「我三日內要再建立起來」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.2.19\">John 2:19</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">），「但耶穌這話是以他的身體為殿」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.2.21\">John 2:21</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。</span></li>\n</ol>\n<p><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">以色列盼望末日的復活（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.11.24\">約 11:24</span>），所以門徒起初不明白一人先復活（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.20.9\">約 20:9</span>）。</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"2b-約-the-covenant\">2b. <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">約</span> The covenant</h3>\n<ol>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">亞伯拉罕：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">耶穌用<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Exod.3.6\">出埃及記 3:6</span> 回答撒都該人：「神不是死人的神，乃是活人的神」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Matt.22.32\">Matt 22:32</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。立約的神不會把他的約留在墳墓裏。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">大衛：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「我必與你們立永約，就是應許大衛那可靠的恩典」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Isa.55.3\">Isa 55:3</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。保羅說，神叫他復活，「不再歸於朽壞」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Acts.13.34\">Acts 13:34</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">），正是成就這約。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">新約：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「那憑永約之血、使群羊的大牧人我主耶穌從死裏復活的神」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Heb.13.20\">Heb 13:20</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。</span>ASV <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">作</span> \"brought again from the dead\" (<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Heb.13.20\">Heb 13:20</span>)<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，希臘文</span> <span lang=\"grc\">ἀναγαγών</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「領上來」：牧人先上來，羊群跟着。見</span> <a class=\"wl\" href=\"#i7a592efe93\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">希伯來書研究</span></a><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">。</span></li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"2c-預表-the-types\">2c. <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">預表</span> The types</h3>\n<ol>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">以撒：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「他也彷彿從死中得回他的兒子來」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Heb.11.19\">Heb 11:19</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。「彷彿」，</span>ASV <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">作</span> \"in a figure\" (<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Heb.11.19\">Heb 11:19</span>)<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，希臘文</span> <span lang=\"grc\">ἐν παραβολῇ</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">約拿：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">三日三夜在大魚肚腹中（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Matt.12.40\">太 12:40</span>），是耶穌親自給的兆頭。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">初熟的果子：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">安息日的次日，把初熟的第一捆搖祭（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Lev.23.10-11\">利 23:10-11</span>）；基督在七日的第一日復活，是「初熟的果子」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.15.20\">1 Cor 15:20</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">），希臘文</span> <span lang=\"grc\">ἀπαρχή</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">（又見 15:23）：第一捆歸神，全部收成隨後就到。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">第三天：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「第三天他必使我們興起」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Hos.6.2\">Hos 6:2</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。新約沒有引用，用字卻與<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Luke.24.46\">路 24:46</span> 相同（第 3 段）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">亞倫的杖</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">（有人這樣讀）：枯杖一夜之間發芽、開花、結杏（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Num.17.8\">民 17:8</span>）。</span></li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"2d-故事-the-stories\">2d. <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">故事</span> The stories</h3>\n<ol>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">以利亞、以利沙：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">撒勒法寡婦的兒子（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Kgs.17.17-24\">王上 17:17-24</span>）、書念婦人的兒子（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"2Kgs.4.32-37\">王下 4:32-37</span>）、碰到以利沙骸骨的死人（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"2Kgs.13.21\">王下 13:21</span>）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">枯骨：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">先有筋、肉、皮，後有氣息（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Ezek.37.1-10\">結 37:1-10</span>）：身體與生命一同恢復。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">耶穌與使徒：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">拿因城寡婦的兒子、睚魯的女兒、拉撒路、多加（路 7；可 5；約 11；徒 9）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">不同之處：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">他們後來都又死了；「基督既從死裏復活，就不再死」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Rom.6.9\">Rom 6:9</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。他是「從死裏首先復生的」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Col.1.18\">Col 1:18</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。</span></li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"2e-在基督裏成全-fulfilled-in-christ\">2e. <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">在基督裏成全</span> Fulfilled in Christ</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"verse\"><div class=\"zh\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">我當日所領受又傳給你們的：第一，就是基督照聖經所說，為我們的罪死了，而且埋葬了；又照聖經所說，第三天復活了，（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.15.3-4\">哥林多前書 15:3-4</span>）</span></div><div class=\"en\">For I delivered unto you first of all that which also I received: that Christ died for our sins according to the scriptures; and that he was buried; and that he hath been raised on the third day according to the scriptures; (<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.15.3-4\">1 Corinthians 15:3-4</span>, ASV)</div></blockquote>\n<ol>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">最早的信經：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「領受」、「傳給」（</span><span lang=\"grc\">παρέλαβον, παρέδωκα</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）是傳遞固定傳統的用語（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.11.23\">林前 11:23</span>）；磯法</span> <span lang=\"grc\">Κηφᾶς</span> <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">是彼得的亞蘭文名字；見證人多半還在（15:5-7）。多數學者認為，保羅在主後 30 年代中期領受這信經（</span>Habermas 2005<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">四福音與使徒的講道：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">細節不同，像獨立的見證人；核心相同：婦女、七日的第一日、空墳墓、與主相遇（太 28；可 16；路 24；約 20–21）。使徒總是說：你們殺了他，神叫他復活，「我們都為這事作見證」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Acts.2.32\">Acts 2:32</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">是身體，不是魂：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">他們「以為所看見的是魂」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Luke.24.37\">Luke 24:37</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">），他卻給他們看手腳，又吃了燒魚（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Luke.24.39-43\">路 24:39-43</span>）；釘痕還在（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.20.27\">約 20:27</span>），細麻布還在（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.20.5-7\">約 20:5-7</span>）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">同一個身體，卻改變了：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">門關着他也能進來（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.20.19\">約 20:19</span>）。「所種的是血氣的身體，復活的是靈性的身體」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.15.44\">1 Cor 15:44</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）：種下的就是復活的，都是</span> <span lang=\"grc\">σῶμα</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">。</span></li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"3-原文-the-words-beneath-it\">3. <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">原文</span> The words beneath it <a class=\"up\" href=\"#%E6%91%98%E8%A6%81-summary\" title=\"回到摘要 back to the summary\">↑</a></h2>\n<div class=\"tw\"><table><thead><tr><th><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">字</span> Word</th><th><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">意思</span> Meaning</th><th><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">新約</span> NT (OpenGNT)</th><th><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">指「復活」</span>Louw–Nida 23.93–94</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span lang=\"grc\">ἀνάστασις</span> <em>anástasis</em></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">復活</span> resurrection<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">；字面「再站起來」</span></td><td>42 <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">次（40 節）</span></td><td>41<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">；另 1 次「興起」（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Luke.2.34\">路 2:34</span>）</span></td></tr><tr><td><span lang=\"grc\">ἀνίστημι</span> <em>anístēmi</em></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">起來、使起來</span> rise, raise up</td><td>108 <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">次（107 節）</span></td><td>31<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">；多半是「站起來」</span></td></tr><tr><td><span lang=\"grc\">ἐγείρω</span> <em>egeírō</em></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">喚醒、使起來</span> wake, raise</td><td>144 <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">次（138 節）</span></td><td>79<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">；48 次「起來」，7 次「睡醒」</span></td></tr><tr><td><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">קוּם</span> <em>qûm</em></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">起來、站立</span> arise, stand</td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">舊約 628 次（595 節，</span>BHSA<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）</span></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">七十士譯本多譯作</span> <span lang=\"grc\">ἀνίστημι</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p><em>Louw–Nida <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">的分類是標注者的判斷，不是量度。</span></em></p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">站起來：</span></strong><span lang=\"grc\">ἀνάστασις</span> <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">出自</span> <span lang=\"grc\">ἀνίστημι</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">（</span><span lang=\"grc\">ἀνά</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「起」加</span> <span lang=\"grc\">ἵστημι</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「站」）。在第一世紀，這個字指身體從死裏起來，從不指靈魂繼續存在（</span>Wright 2003<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">中文看不出的時態：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">天使說「他已經復活了」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Mark.16.6\">Mark 16:6</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">），</span><span lang=\"grc\">ἠγέρθη</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，說的是那件事；保羅用完成式</span> <span lang=\"grc\">ἐγήγερται</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.15.4\">林前 15:4</span>, <span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.15.20\">20</span>）：復活了，現在仍活着。和合本都作「復活」，</span>ASV <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">卻分開：</span>\"he is risen\" (<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Mark.16.6\">Mark 16:6</span>)<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，</span>\"hath been raised\" (<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.15.4\">1 Cor 15:4</span>)<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">七十士譯本的橋樑</span></strong><code></code><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">：</span><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">קוּם</span> → <span lang=\"grc\">ἀνίστημι</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，595 節中有 356 節（機率預期的 33 倍）；</span>→ <span lang=\"grc\">ἐγείρω</span> <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">只有 13 節。<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Isa.26.19\">賽 26:19</span> 的</span> <span lang=\"grc\">αναστήσονται οι νεκροί και εγερθήσονται οι εν τοις μνημείοις</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「死人要起來，墳墓裏的要被喚醒」（直譯）：兩個新約動詞同在一節，</span><span lang=\"grc\">μνημεῖον</span> <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">正是福音書說耶穌墳墓的字。<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Hos.6.2\">何 6:2</span> 的「興起」就是</span> <span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">קוּם</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">（</span><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">יְקִמֵנוּ</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">），七十士譯本</span> <span lang=\"grc\">τη ημέρα τη τρίτη αναστησόμεθα</span> <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">與<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Luke.24.46\">路 24:46</span> 的</span> <span lang=\"grc\">ἀναστῆναι</span> … <span lang=\"grc\">τῇ τρίτῃ ἡμέρᾳ</span> <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">用字相同。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">詩</span> 16:10 → <span lang=\"zh-Hant\"><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Acts.2.27\">徒 2:27</span>：</span></strong><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">שַׁחַת</span> <em>shachath</em> <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">可以是「坑」，也可以是「朽壞」；七十士譯本在 23 節中有 9 節譯作</span> <span lang=\"grc\">διαφθορά</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「腐爛」，<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Ps.16.10\">詩 16:10</span> 是其中之一。彼得、保羅按這個字講：大衛朽壞了，基督沒有（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Acts.2.31\">徒 2:31</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Acts.13.35-37\">13:35-37</span>）。和合本作「見朽壞」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Acts.2.27\">Acts 2:27</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">），</span>ASV <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">作</span> \"see corruption\" (<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Acts.2.27\">Acts 2:27</span>)<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">沒有希伯來文名詞：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">舊約只用動詞：</span><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">קוּם</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「起來」、</span><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">קוּץ</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「醒」、</span><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">חָיָה</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「活」（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Isa.26.19\">賽 26:19</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Dan.12.2\">但 12:2</span>）。</span><span lang=\"grc\">ἀνάστασις</span> <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">在七十士譯本有原文的書卷中只出現兩次（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Lam.3.63\">哀 3:63</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Zeph.3.8\">番 3:8</span>），都是平常的「起來」。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">靈性的身體：</span></strong><span lang=\"grc\">ψυχικόν</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">、</span><span lang=\"grc\">πνευματικόν</span> <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">出自</span> <span lang=\"grc\">ψυχή</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「魂」、</span><span lang=\"grc\">πνεῦμα</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「靈」（</span><a class=\"wl\" href=\"#i8c27271254\">S5 <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">魂與靈</span></a><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。</span><em>Spiritual</em> <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">不是</span> <em>made of spirit</em><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，而是被聖靈掌管（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.2.15\">林前 2:15</span>），「和他自己榮耀的身體相似」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Phil.3.21\">Phil 3:21</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。</span></li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"4-共同的信仰-what-all-confess\">4. <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">共同的信仰</span> What all confess <a class=\"up\" href=\"#%E6%91%98%E8%A6%81-summary\" title=\"回到摘要 back to the summary\">↑</a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">尼西亞信經（381）：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「照聖經所載第三日復活；」……「我們期待死人復活及來世生命。」（合一中譯本）</span>\"On the third day he rose again / in accordance with the Scriptures;\" … \"We look for the resurrection of the dead,\" (ELLC 1988)</li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">使徒信經</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">（西方的信經；東正教以尼西亞信經認信同樣的信仰）：「第三天從死裏復活；」……「我信身體復活；」</span>\"the resurrection of the body,\" (ELLC 1988)<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">。拉丁文</span> <em>carnis resurrectionem</em> <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">字面是「肉身的復活」，天主教中文作「我信肉身的復活」（《天主教教理》第十一條）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">不同之處：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">在這真理上沒有分歧，只是東正教按儒略曆推算復活節：2026 年西方在 4 月 5 日（講道〈身體復活的應許與大能〉那天），東正教在 4 月 12 日。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">信經</span> Creeds<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">：</span></strong><span class=\"off\">AC 9</span> · <span class=\"off\">NC 19–20</span> · <span class=\"off\">AT 38</span> · <span class=\"off\">WCF VIII</span> · <span class=\"off\">WLC 51–56</span> · <span class=\"off\">WSC 20–28</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">；全文與各行連結：</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">信經與信條</span> Creeds and confessions</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"5-為何重要-why-it-matters\">5. <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">為何重要</span> Why it matters <a class=\"up\" href=\"#%E6%91%98%E8%A6%81-summary\" title=\"回到摘要 back to the summary\">↑</a></h2>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">為信仰。</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「沒有耶穌的復活，基督教的整個根基就會倒塌」（</span>\"without the resurrection of Jesus, the whole foundation of Christianity will fall down\"<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。保羅也這樣說：</span></p>\n<blockquote class=\"verse\"><div class=\"zh\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">若基督沒有復活，我們所傳的便是枉然，你們所信的也是枉然；（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.15.14\">哥林多前書 15:14</span>）</span></div><div class=\"en\">and if Christ hath not been raised, then is our preaching vain, your faith also is vain. (<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.15.14\">1 Corinthians 15:14</span>, ASV)</div></blockquote>\n<p><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">接着：「你們仍在罪裏」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.15.17\">1 Cor 15:17</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">），「就算比眾人更可憐」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.15.19\">1 Cor 15:19</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）；然後一轉：「但基督已經從死裏復活」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.15.20\">1 Cor 15:20</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。復活也「以大能顯明是神的兒子」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Rom.1.4\">Rom 1:4</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">五個理由</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">（復活節講道末頁）：應驗聖經（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Luke.24.46\">路 24:46</span>）；成就救恩，「復活，是為叫我們稱義」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Rom.4.25\">Rom 4:25</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）；確證我們的復活（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.15.20-22\">林前 15:20-22</span>）；戰勝罪、死與撒旦（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.15.54-57\">林前 15:54-57</span>）；與眾聖徒在新天新地永遠掌權（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Rev.22.5\">啟 22:5</span>）。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">為基督徒的生活。</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">受洗歸入他的死，「原是叫我們一舉一動有新生的樣式」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Rom.6.4\">Rom 6:4</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）；我們要「曉得他復活的大能」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Phil.3.10\">Phil 3:10</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）；所以勞苦不是徒然的（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.15.58\">林前 15:58</span>）。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">為人的存在。</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">神要救贖的是整個人，「乃是我們的身體得贖」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Rom.8.23\">Rom 8:23</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）；基督要「釋放那些一生因怕死而為奴僕的人」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Heb.2.15\">Heb 2:15</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。人活着不是要逃離身體，而是用這必朽的身體，作不朽的工。</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"5a-十項史實-the-ten-facts\">5a. <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">十項史實</span> The ten facts</h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">《耶穌真的從死裏復活了嗎》投影片 （</span>Habermas 2003<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">；</span>Geisler &amp; Turek 2004<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）：</span></p>\n<ol>\n<li><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">耶穌被羅馬人釘十字架而死。</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">他被埋葬，很可能葬在私人的墳墓裏。</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">門徒灰心喪志，失去盼望。</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">不久，人們發現他的墳墓空了。</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">門徒相信復活的耶穌真實向他們顯現。</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">他們的生命徹底改變，甚至願意為信仰而死。</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">復活的宣講從教會之初就開始。</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">就在耶路撒冷，他被釘、被埋葬的地方，公開傳講。</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">耶穌的弟弟雅各，本是懷疑者，因相信見到了復活的耶穌而歸信。</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">大數的掃羅（保羅）因復活的耶穌向他顯現而歸信。</span></li>\n</ol>\n<p><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">第 1、5、9、10 項幾乎所有批判學者都承認，第 4 項多數承認（</span>Habermas &amp; Licona 2004<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）；1975 年以來有 1,400 多篇相關著作；其中討論空墳墓的學者，約</span> 75% <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">支持（</span>Habermas 2005<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。</span><em><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">從統計的角度看：這是著作的計數，不是隨機樣本。</span></em></p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">幾年之內，猶太信徒不再獻祭，不受摩西律法約束，敬拜三一的神，守主日，接受受苦的彌賽亞，以洗禮和聖餐代替割禮。這麼大的改變，需要一個同樣大的原因。</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"5b-六個質疑-six-objections\">5b. <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">六個質疑</span> Six objections</h3>\n<ol>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">昏厥說：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">兵丁確認他死了，槍扎出血和水（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.19.34\">約 19:34</span>；</span><em>JAMA</em> 1986<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。懷疑派的施特勞斯也說，半死、需要醫治的人，不能叫人相信他是</span> \"the Prince of Life\"<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">（</span>Strauss 1879<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">偷屍說：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">最早的反對說法，卻先承認了墳墓是空的（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Matt.28.13\">太 28:13</span>）。使徒為這見證被打、被殺（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Acts.5.40-41\">徒 5:40-41</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Acts.12.2\">12:2</span>）；人不會為明知是假的事而死（見第 7 段寇爾森）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">走錯墳墓：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">婦女看見了安放他的地方（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Mark.15.47\">可 15:47</span>）；墳墓是亞利馬太人約瑟的（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Matt.27.57-60\">太 27:57-60</span>）；當局一指就夠了。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">幻覺說：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">五百多人同時看見（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.15.6\">林前 15:6</span>）；懷疑的雅各、逼迫教會的保羅都不是哀傷的門徒；幻覺不吃魚，也不移走屍體（</span>Wright 2003<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">傳說：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">信經出自最初幾年。編傳說的人不會用婦女作見證：約瑟夫記載的律法說</span> \"let not the testimony of women be admitted\"<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">（</span>Josephus, <em>Antiquities</em> 4.219<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">只是靈性的復活：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">那樣墳墓就不會空，<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Luke.24.39\">路 24:39</span> 也不真。</span></li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"6-實踐-in-practice\">6. <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">實踐</span> In practice <a class=\"up\" href=\"#%E6%91%98%E8%A6%81-summary\" title=\"回到摘要 back to the summary\">↑</a></h2>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">復活節講道：復活盼望帶來的生命改變</span></strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">有大喜樂：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「你們是大有喜樂」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Pet.1.6\">1 Pet 1:6</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。又見<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Rom.5.3-5\">羅 5:3-5</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Jas.1.2-4\">雅 1:2-4</span>。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">無懼生老病死：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">我們會哀傷，卻不像「那些沒有指望的人一樣」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Thess.4.13\">1 Thess 4:13</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。又見詩 23。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">以受苦的心志武裝自己：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「你們也當將這樣的心志作為兵器」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Pet.4.1\">1 Pet 4:1</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">成就我們的救恩：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「作成你們得救的工夫」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Phil.2.12\">Phil 2:12</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。又見<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Eph.2.8-10\">弗 2:8-10</span>。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">預備並渴望主再來：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\"><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Pet.1.13\">彼前 1:13</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"2Pet.3.10-13\">彼後 3:10-13</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Matt.25.1-13\">太 25:1-13</span>。</span></li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">再加一點：愛惜身體。</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「神已經叫主復活，也要用自己的能力叫我們復活」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.6.14\">1 Cor 6:14</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">），所以我們照顧它，用它服事（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.6.19-20\">林前 6:19-20</span>）。</span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">講道的勉勵：「如果你從別人身上看不到耶穌，那麼就讓別人從你身上看到耶穌吧！」</span></p>\n<h2 id=\"7-連在一起-connected\">7. <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">連在一起</span> Connected <a class=\"up\" href=\"#%E6%91%98%E8%A6%81-summary\" title=\"回到摘要 back to the summary\">↑</a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">原文研究：</span></strong><a class=\"wl\" href=\"#ibd4fbde8cb\">S16 <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">指望</span></a><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">：「活潑的盼望」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Pet.1.3\">1 Pet 1:3</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）來自復活，所以錨拋得穩。</span><a class=\"wl\" href=\"#i8bc7800290\">S14</a><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">：「死人復活」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Heb.6.2\">Heb 6:2</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）是根基，根基穩了才能前進。</span><a class=\"wl\" href=\"#ic4045911a0\">S12</a><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">：他向「那能救他免死的主」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Heb.5.7\">Heb 5:7</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）禱告，蒙了應允；無路可走時，我們也這樣禱告。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">書卷研究：</span></strong><a class=\"wl\" href=\"#i7a592efe93\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">希伯來書</span></a> 13:20 <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">把永約之血與復活相連；那卷書講「不可退後」，這一課講「憑甚麼不退後」。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">講道：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">耶穌真的從死裡復活了嗎？</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">（第 5 段）</span>· <a class=\"ext\" href=\"https://sauchilee.github.io/preaching/%E8%BA%AB%E9%AB%94%E5%BE%A9%E6%B4%BB%E7%9A%84%E6%87%89%E8%A8%B1%E8%88%87%E5%A4%A7%E8%83%BD_%E8%AC%9B%E7%AB%A0PPT.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">身體復活的應許與大能</span></a><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">（第 6 段）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">世界觀察：寇爾森與水門案</span> Charles Colson</strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">（</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">人物</span> Personalities</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）：尼克森總統的特別顧問，水門案中信主，坐牢七個月，後來創立監獄團契。他說（大意）：總統身邊十來個有權勢的人，幾個星期就守不住謊言；使徒面對鞭打和死亡，沒有一個改口。一句：它回答偷屍說；我們也作至死不改口的見證人。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">世界觀察：倖存者之樹</span> The Survivor Tree</strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">（</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">九一一事件</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，第 3.3 段）：2001 年在世貿瓦礫中找到的豆梨樹，樹幹焦黑；2010 年種回紀念館廣場，新枝從焦黑的樹幹長出來。復活的主也保留了傷痕：「伸出你的手來，探入我的肋旁」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.20.27\">John 20:27</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。一句：復活不是抹去傷痕，而是從傷痕長出新生命（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Job.14.7\">伯 14:7</span>, <span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Job.14.14\">14</span>）；把焦黑處帶到他面前。</span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2 id=\"8-應用與講道-for-us-and-for-the-preacher\">8. <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">應用與講道</span> For us, and for the preacher <a class=\"up\" href=\"#%E6%91%98%E8%A6%81-summary\" title=\"回到摘要 back to the summary\">↑</a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">復活節先是歷史，後是感受：墳墓空了，見證人與他同吃同喝（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Acts.10.41\">徒 10:41</span>）。</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">身體很寶貴：「所種的是軟弱的，復活的是強壯的」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.15.43\">1 Cor 15:43</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">思考：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">假如墳墓沒有空，你這個星期的生活會有甚麼不同？</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">講道：<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.15.20\">林前 15:20</span>，三點</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>A<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「但」</span><span lang=\"grc\">Νυνὶ δέ</span>, but now<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">：事實。</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">從 15:13-19 一連串的「若」，轉到這個「但」：他復活了，現在仍活着（第 3 段）。</span></li>\n<li><strong>B<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「初熟的果子」：保證。</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">第一捆歸神，全部收成隨後就到（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.15.23\">林前 15:23</span>）。</span></li>\n<li><strong>C<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「睡了」：盼望。</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">信徒的死只是睡（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Thess.4.13-14\">帖前 4:13-14</span>），所以要常常竭力多作主工（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.15.58\">林前 15:58</span>）。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"9-複習-five-review-questions\">9. <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">複習</span> Five review questions <a class=\"up\" href=\"#%E6%91%98%E8%A6%81-summary\" title=\"回到摘要 back to the summary\">↑</a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「身體復活」是甚麼意思？與拉撒路有何不同？</span></strong>\n<p><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">被釘、被埋葬的同一個身體復活，成為不朽壞的，不是魂（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Luke.24.37-39\">路 24:37-39</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.15.42-44\">林前 15:42-44</span>）。拉撒路復甦後又死了；基督就不再死（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Rom.6.9\">羅 6:9</span>）。</span></p></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">舊約怎樣預備了復活？在應許、約、預表、故事中各舉一例。</span></strong>\n<p><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">應許：<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Ps.16.10\">詩 16:10</span>（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Acts.2.27-31\">徒 2:27-31</span>）、<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Dan.12.2\">但 12:2</span>。約：神是活人的神（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Matt.22.32\">太 22:32</span>）。預表：以撒（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Heb.11.19\">來 11:19</span>）、約拿（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Matt.12.40\">太 12:40</span>）、初熟的果子（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.15.20\">林前 15:20</span>）。故事：以利亞、以利沙、枯骨（王上 17；王下 4；結 37）。</span></p></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"grc\">ἀνάστασις</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">、</span><span lang=\"grc\">ἐγείρω</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">、</span><span lang=\"grc\">ἀνίστημι</span> <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">與</span> <span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">קוּם</span> <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">告訴我們甚麼？</span></strong>\n<p><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">復活是身體「站起來」、「被喚醒」（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Luke.24.46\">路 24:46</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Matt.28.6\">太 28:6</span>）；七十士譯本多以</span> <span lang=\"grc\">ἀνίστημι</span> <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">譯</span> <span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">קוּם</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">；</span><span lang=\"grc\">ἐγήγερται</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">：他復活了，現在仍活着（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.15.4\">林前 15:4</span>, <span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.15.20\">20</span>）；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Ps.16.10\">詩 16:10</span> 的</span> <span lang=\"grc\">διαφθορά</span> <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">是使徒論證的關鍵（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Acts.2.27\">徒 2:27</span>, <span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Acts.2.31\">31</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Acts.13.35-37\">13:35-37</span>）。</span></p></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">為甚麼沒有復活就沒有基督教？有甚麼憑據？</span></strong>\n<p><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">沒有復活，傳道、信心都枉然，我們仍在罪裏（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.15.14-19\">林前 15:14-19</span>）。憑據：最早的信經與見證人（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.15.3-8\">林前 15:3-8</span>）、空墳墓（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Luke.24.3\">路 24:3</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.20.1-8\">約 20:1-8</span>）、門徒的改變（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Acts.4.33\">徒 4:33</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Acts.5.40-41\">5:40-41</span>）、雅各與保羅歸信（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.7.5\">約 7:5</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Gal.1.13-16\">加 1:13-16</span>）。</span></p></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">復活的盼望怎樣改變今天的生活？</span></strong>\n<p><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">喜樂（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Pet.1.6\">彼前 1:6</span>）；不怕死（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Heb.2.14-15\">來 2:14-15</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Thess.4.13\">帖前 4:13</span>）；以受苦的心志為兵器（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Pet.4.1-2\">彼前 4:1-2</span>）；作成得救的工夫（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Phil.2.12-13\">腓 2:12-13</span>）；預備主再來（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Matt.25.1-13\">太 25:1-13</span>）；勞苦不是徒然的（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.15.58\">林前 15:58</span>）。</span></p></li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"10-連結與出處-links-and-sources\">10. <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">連結與出處</span> Links and sources <a class=\"up\" href=\"#%E6%91%98%E8%A6%81-summary\" title=\"回到摘要 back to the summary\">↑</a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">範疇：</span></strong><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">基督論</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">；</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">末世論</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">（10.03 復活）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">前後課：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">下一課</span> <a class=\"wl\" href=\"#i2f493f5679\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">第 2 課 基督再來</span></a><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">：復活的身體要再來（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Acts.1.11\">徒 1:11</span>）。又見</span> <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">第 10 課 福音</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">、</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">第 18 課 身體復活</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">、</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">第 24 課 升天</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">資料：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">和合本、</span>ASV 1901<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">；</span>OpenGNT 3.3<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">；</span>BHSA<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">；</span>七十士譯本（ABP：Sixtine 1587，經 Bos 1709）<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">書目：</span></strong>Habermas, <em>The Risen Jesus and Future Hope</em> (2003); Geisler &amp; Turek, <em>I Don't Have Enough Faith to Be an Atheist</em> (2004); Habermas &amp; Licona, <em>The Case for the Resurrection of Jesus</em> (2004); Habermas, <em>JSHJ</em> 3.2 (2005); Wright, <em>The Resurrection of the Son of God</em> (2003); Edwards, Gabel &amp; Hosmer, <em>JAMA</em> 255.11 (1986); Strauss, <em>The Life of Jesus for the People</em> (1879), vol. 1, p. 412; Josephus, <em>Antiquities</em> 4.219.</li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">信經：</span></strong>ELLC, <em>Praying Together</em> (1988)<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">；《尼西亞信經》合一中譯本；《使徒信經》（</span>CCEL<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）；《天主教教理》第十一條。</span> English translations of the Apostles' Creed and the Nicene Creed © 1988 English Language Liturgical Consultation (ELLC), and used by permission. www.englishtexts.org</li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">例證：</span></strong>Colson: Wikipedia; BreakPoint, 29 Apr 2002. Survivor Tree: 911memorial.org (the 9/11 case, S7, S8).</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"tag-words-標籤詞\">Tag words <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">標籤詞</span> <a class=\"up\" href=\"#%E6%91%98%E8%A6%81-summary\" title=\"回到摘要 back to the summary\">↑</a></h2>\n<p>#t/resurrection <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">復活</span> · #t/body <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">體</span> · #t/hope <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">盼望</span> · #t/apostle <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">使徒</span> · #t/disciple <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">門徒</span> · #t/preaching <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">講道</span> · #t/eschatology <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">末世</span> · #ch/constantine-and-councils <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">國教化與大公會議</span><br></p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">四語</span> Four faces</strong> — <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">中文</span> · English · Hebrew · Greek (H/G = Strong's, n× = times in the Hebrew OT / Greek NT):</p>\n<ul>\n<li>#t/resurrection <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">復活</span> · resurrection · <span class=\"off\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">קוּם</span></span> H6965 628× (<span class=\"off\">Qal</span>) · <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ἐγείρω</span></span> G1453 144× / <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ἀνίστημι</span></span> G450 108× / <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ἀνάστασις</span></span> G386 42×</li>\n<li>#t/body <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">體</span> · body · <span class=\"off\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">גְּוִיָּה</span></span> H1472 13× · <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">σῶμα</span></span> G4983 142×</li>\n<li>#t/hope <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">盼望</span> · hope · <a class=\"wl\" href=\"#ibd4fbde8cb\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">קָוָה</span></a> H6960 50× (<span class=\"off\">Piel</span>) / <a class=\"wl\" href=\"#ibd4fbde8cb\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">תִּקְוָה</span></a> H8615 34× · <a class=\"wl\" href=\"#ibd4fbde8cb\"><span lang=\"grc\">ἐλπίς</span></a> G1680 53× / <a class=\"wl\" href=\"#ibd4fbde8cb\"><span lang=\"grc\">ἐλπίζω</span></a> G1679 31×</li>\n<li>#t/apostle <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">使徒</span> · apostle · <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ἀπόστολος</span></span> G652 80×</li>\n<li>#t/disciple <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">門徒</span> · disciple · <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">μαθητής</span></span> G3101 261×</li>\n<li>#t/preaching <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">講道</span> · preaching · <span class=\"off\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">בָּשַׂר</span></span> H1319 24× (<span class=\"off\">Piel</span>) · <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">κηρύσσω</span></span> G2784 61× / <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">εὐαγγελίζω</span></span> G2097 54× / <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">κήρυγμα</span></span> G2782 9×</li>\n<li>#t/eschatology <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">末世</span> · eschatology (KJV last) · <span class=\"off\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">אַחֲרִית</span></span> H319 61× · <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ἔσχατος</span></span> G2078 52×</li>\n</ul><details class=\"pn across\" open><summary>跨燈 <i lang=\"en\">Across the lamps</i></summary><p class=\"acr\" data-b=\"3\"></p></details>"}});
